  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rio de Janeiro Sustainable Rural Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to increase the adoption of integrated and sustainable farming systems approaches in specific areasof the Borrower&apos;s territory and help re-establish an agricultural productive environment in areas of the Serrana Region affected bythe January 2011 natural disastercomma thus contributing to the higher-order objective of increasing small-scale farming productivity and competitiveness in those areas.</narrative>
  </description>
